{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"次典范拓扑"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"次典范拓扑"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck 拓扑"}},{"Plain":" $J$, 若所有"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":"均为"},{"Local":{"url":"景上的层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":", 即"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C\\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Psh}(\\mathcal C)$ 落在"},{"Local":{"url":"层意象","text":"层范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$ 中, 则称 $J$ 为<strong>次典范</strong> (subcanonical) Grothendieck 拓扑.</p>\n"}]}}